Firmware for external USB WiFi adapters, built into the kernel image through
CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE (see arch/arm64/configs/magisk_defconfig). The drivers
themselves are modules; the firmware stays in the image (about 190 kB) so it
is found no matter which process probes the adapter.

All files are unmodified copies from the linux-firmware repository, tag 20240115
(https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git).

  ath9k_htc/htc_9271-1.4.0.fw, ath9k_htc/htc_7010-1.4.0.fw
      driver ath9k_htc (AR9271, AR7010)      licence: LICENCE.atheros_firmware
  carl9170-1.fw
      driver carl9170 (AR9170)               licence: GPLv2, source: carl9170fw in linux-firmware
  rt2870.bin, rt73.bin
      drivers rt2800usb, rt73usb             licence: LICENCE.ralink-firmware.txt
  mt7601u.bin
      driver mt7601u                         licence: LICENCE.ralink_a_mediatek_company_firmware
